    "description": "Discover secret requests from annotations of the form '<prefix>-secret-<name>: <path>'. The trailing <name> becomes the secret identifier and the value becomes its source path. By default the name is lower-cased; when a preserve-case flag is enabled the original casing is kept. Names may contain dashes, underscores and dots. An empty or absent name produces no secret."
